Abstract: Working draft of DASH-IF IOP v5 Part 2, covering core DASH principles and the mapping of CMAF content structures to DASH Media Presentations. Drafted from the Part 2 working draft and carried-over DASH-IF IOP v4.3 basics.

!Issue Tracking: <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues?q=is%3Aopen+project%3ADash-Industry-Forum%2F28">Currently open Part 2 issues</a> | <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues/new?title=%5BPart+2%5D%3A+">File a new Part 2 issue</a>
!Document Status: <strong>Working Draft 0.1</strong>. Note: See <a href="https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part01-overview.html#document-status">Annex A: Document Status</a> for versioning and workflow.
!Contributors: Contributors are maintained via GitHub pull requests to the <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5">IOPv5 repository</a>.
!Contributing: See <a href="https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part01-overview.html#contributing">Part 1 §1.4 Contributing and Reviewing</a>.
!Key Words: Core Principles, CMAF, DASH, Timing Model, SegmentTemplate, SegmentTimeline, Multi-Period
